  <name>System Bridge</name>
  <summary>Share your system's information and controls with Home Assistant</summary>
  <developer id="dev.timmo">
    <name>Aidan Timson</name>
  </developer>
  <description>
    <p>
      System Bridge runs in the background and shares information about your computer over a local HTTP and WebSocket API, so other applications can monitor and control it.
    </p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Monitor CPU, memory, disks, networks, GPUs, sensors, battery, displays and media</li>
      <li>Control media playback, audio, displays, power and notifications remotely</li>
      <li>Connect to Home Assistant through its official System Bridge integration</li>
      <li>View your data and manage settings in the built-in web client</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
